./gsa.js is a JavaScript port of the global sensitivity analysis methods of
GlobalSensitivity.jl, https://github.com/SciML/GlobalSensitivity.jl (v2.12.8),
and of the parts of three packages those methods rely on: the kernel density
estimate of KernelDensity.jl, https://github.com/JuliaStats/KernelDensity.jl,
the quadratic B-spline of Interpolations.jl,
https://github.com/JuliaMath/Interpolations.jl, through which that estimate is
read, and the histogram binning of ComplexityMeasures.jl,
https://github.com/JuliaDynamics/ComplexityMeasures.jl. All four are licensed
under the MIT "Expat" License, and so is the port. Their notices follow.

